                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is LinkedIn worth it for D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>Only for B2B-adjacent D2C categories: corporate gifting, B2B wellness, executive services, premium F&B for office consumption. Not for pure consumer D2C.</p>
                                        <h3>What is LinkedIn CPM vs Meta CPM?</h3>
                                        <p>LinkedIn 4-15x more expensive per impression. Justified only when audience quality (professional decision-makers) + AOV supports.</p>
                                        <h3>Should corporate gifting brands use LinkedIn?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — targeting HR + Admin + Marketing decision-makers 8-10 weeks before major corporate gifting occasions (Diwali + Christmas + year-end).</p>
                                        <h3>What is CPL benchmark on LinkedIn?</h3>
                                        <p>$80-500 typical range. High-quality B2B leads justify vs consumer channels for right categories.</p>
